{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 76,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "In Judah, God is known.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "在， 神为人所认识； ，他的名为大。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "在，上帝為人所認識； ，他的名為大。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "His tabernacle is also in Salem. His dwelling place in Zion.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "在有他的帐幕； 有他的居所。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "在有他的帳幕； 有他的居所。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "There he broke the flaming arrows of the bow, the shield, and the sword, and the weapons of war.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他在那里折断弓上的火箭， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他在那裏折斷弓上的火箭， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Glorious are you, and excellent, more than mountains of game.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你从有野食之山而来，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你從有野食之山而來，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Valiant men lie plundered, their last sleep. of the men of war can lift their hands.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "心中勇敢的人都被抢夺；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "心中勇敢的人都被搶奪；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "At your rebuke, God of Jacob, both chariot and horse are cast into a dead sleep.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "的 神啊，你的斥责一发， 车的、马的都沉睡了。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "的上帝啊，你的斥責一發， 車的、馬的都沉睡了。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "You, even you, are to be feared. in your sight when you are angry?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "惟独你是可畏的！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "惟獨你是可畏的！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "You pronounced judgment from heaven. The earth feared, and was silent,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8-9",
      "en": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你从天上使人听判断。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你從天上使人聽判斷。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "when God arose to judgment, to save all the afflicted ones of the earth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "Surely the wrath of man praises you. The survivors of your wrath are restrained.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "人的忿怒要成全你的荣美；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "人的忿怒要成全你的榮美；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "Make vows to the LORD your God, and fulfill them! of his neighbors bring presents to him who is to be feared.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们许愿，当向耶和华—你们的 神还愿；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們許願，當向耶和華－你們的上帝還願；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "He will cut off the spirit of princes. He is feared by the kings of the earth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他要挫折王子的骄气；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他要挫折王子的驕氣；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}